iveMe:"Re-LiveMe",liveMe:"LiveMe",reLiveMeCreatingNow:"LiveMe Generating",reLiveMeCreatingTip:"Generating a unique LiveMe photo. Stay tuned!",reLiveSubmit:"Image generation failed, please try again later.",reLiveFail:"Image generation failed, please try again later.",reLiveUploadImageTip:"Please upload an image first.",liveMeNotImageTip:"Please click the Re-LiveMe button to generate an image before creating a video",generatingNotCompleted:"Please complete the current video generation task before switching.",taskNotCompleted:"There are unfinished tasks on the current page, please complete them before switching.",upgradeTip:"LiveMe - Discover a new you!",upgradeTitle:"One photo, hundreds of thousands of styles to choose from!",upgradeSubTitle:"One photo, hundreds of thousands of styles to choose from!",upgradeDesc:"👗 Transform into an elegant retro goddess\n💪 Become a vibrant fitness enthusiast\n👑 Travel back as Cleopatra\n🌴 Transform into a jungle explorer\n🎭 Cosplay your favorite anime character\nUpload your photo, unlock your wonderful life!",latestUpdates:"Latest Updates!",firstSceneChangeTip:"Upload a photo and generate a free video! Cute pets, fantasy blockbusters, touching moments, and stunning scenes, make your video surpass 99% of the works!",firstGenerateLiveMeTip:"Wow! This style suits you perfectly! You've outperformed 99% of users. We offer hundreds of thousands of style parameters, give it a try!",imageFormatTips:"Only PNG, JPEG or WEBP file formats are allowed!",generateImageTip:"Generate the image you want by simply using text.",tryLiveMeTip:"Try clicking LiveMe",liveMeGenerateTip:"Wow! This style suits you perfectly! You've outperformed 99% of users. We offer hundreds of thousands of style parameters, give it a try!",loading:"Loading",imgLoadingFail:"Image loading failed!",reLiveFailNoPeople:"Please upload a photo containing people. Selfies and life photos work well.",dressUp:"LiveMe",changeIt:"Re-LiveMe",uploadSelfie:"Upload Selfie",tryDressUp:"Try clicking the LiveMe button",reLiveMeCountTitle:"🎭 Try a different selfie?",reLiveMeCountContent:"This time AI might transform you into... (Loading animation: ❓→👽→🦸→🐶)",firstGenerateTipTitle:"Create Videos Instantly",firstGenerateTipContent:"Mix your prompts with images and watch AI create amazing videos",reLiveMeByoUploadImg:"Upload a photo of yourself and see what AI will transform you into! (Loading animation: ❓→👽→🦸→🐶)",gereateVideoNotMember:"Generating your video at 2x speed",videoPrompt:"Video Prompt",videoPromatDefaltText:"Prompts control video generation. Enter concise instructions and try different combinations to optimize results.",talk:"Talk",image:"Image",music:"Music",musicFormatTips:"Only mp3 or wav file formats are allowed!",notBgMusicTitle:"Please select a background music",noMusic:"No Music",uploading:"Uploading",generatingToUrlTip:"Optimizing your video",requestFail:"Request failed, please refresh the page!",jobIdLoadingTip:"Preparing resources for video creation...",selectVideoModel:"Select Video Model",realMotionModelDesc:"Ultra-fast and realistic multi-modal video generation Engine",wanModelDesc:"comprehensive and open suite of video foundation models",genSpeech:"Gen-speech",uploadAudio:"Upload audio",RecordAudio:"Record audio",startVideoCreation:"Start Video Creation",wan21ModelDesc:"Supporting Open Source Video Models 💪 Wan2.1 Model Released",wan21ModelDescContent:'\n        We fully support open source video models. Video generation consumes computing power, but we want to support your continuous creative inspiration as much as possible.\n        <div style="margin: 10px 0;">The Wan model generation is currently set to only consume 10 Meme points, allowing you to try many creative ideas 🚀.</div>\n        The current model can generate 4-second videos, and with proper prompts, you can get good content. To continuously improve, welcome to discuss with us on the Discord forum - your suggestions are crucial to us!\n      ',lipsyncTarget:"Lip sync target: {target}",lipsyncTargetDesc:"Suggest {target} head image clear without occlusion, supports talking and singing",lipsyncTargetDescContent:"DIGEN exclusive LipsMotionGen-2 model supports precise lip-sync control for humans and animals, allowing them to talk or sing according to different voices. It's very convenient in scenarios like advertising, education, and Meme videos, making it the most advanced lip-sync model available today.",human:"Human",animal:"Animal",LipMotionGen2:"Lip Motion Gen-2",LipMotionGen2VersionTitle:"The Leading Lip Motion Gen-2 Model is Now Live",LipMotionGen2VersionContent:"\n    We are excited to announce the launch of the Lips Motion Gen-2 model, which supports precise lip synchronization for both characters and animals. Whether it's for dialogue or singing, the model precisely synchronizes to different audio inputs. You can create movie-quality dialogues, engaging children's stories, amusing cat speech clips, and viral meme videos. We firmly believe that the advanced Lips Motion Gen-2 lip-sync model will greatly enhance your creative capabilities. We highly recommend enabling the lip synchronization feature immediately to experience its capabilities.\n    ",promptEnhance:"Prompt Enhance",videoControl:"Video Control",controlMode:"Control Mode",startFrame:"Start Frame",endFrame:"End Frame",notPointsTitle:"Creation quota has been used up!",waitInQueue:"Waiting in generation queue...",clickToGenerate:"Click the button to generate video now.",genSuccessVideo:"{num} Video Generated Successfully",generationTasks:"{num} generation tasks.",noGenerationTasks:"No generation tasks",rmGenStatus:"RealMotion Gen Status",fullTaskQueueTips:"You currently have {num} generation tasks in progress, please submit new tasks later. To ensure generation speed for all community users, task numbers have been limited. We are working on expanding the generation queue capacity to better support your creative work.",fullTaskQueueTipsForRetry:"You currently have {num} generation tasks in progress, please submit new tasks later.",autoGenerateTips:"You can continue to create new content. Submitted tasks will be automatically generated.",waitingCreation:"Waiting for your video creation.",confirmGenerateSameTitle:"Confirm generating the same content?",confirmGenerateSameContent:"The generated results will not differ much. It's advisable to check the generated results or adjust the prompts, add music, or lip shapes to try different combinations."}},XK=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,default:JK},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),_K=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,default:{profile:{visitor:"Visitor",free:"Free",pro:"Pro",proPlan:"Plan",freePlan:"RealMotion users",feedback:"Feedback",logOut:"Log out",profile:"Profile",online:"Online",queue:"Queue",people:"People",language:"Language",success:"Success",communityGrowthPlan:"Community Growth Plan",communityGrowthPlanTips:"Generated videos will be promoted by the recommendation engine"}}},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),$K={settings:{settings:"Settings",profile:"Profile",settingsDesc:"View profile, plans, billing, invitation, and more.",myPhoto:"My Photo",myPhotoTips:"Square picture, png, jpg, webp or other picture formats, no larger than 1MB.",username:"Username",email:"Email",language:"Language",save:"Save",subscriptions:"Subscriptions",creditPlan:"Credit Plan",starter:"Starter",creator:"Creator",pro:"Pro",free:"Free",upgrade:"Upgrade",subscribe:"Subscribe",creditToVideo:"0.5 credit = 30s video",videoDuration:"Video duration is rounded up to to 30-seconds.",creditWill:"Credits will reset at the beginning of each billing cycle.",unsubscribe:"Unsubscribe",paymentHistory:"Payment History",name:"Name",paymentAmount:"Payment Amount",credits:"Credits",datePurchased:"Date Purchased",expirationDate:"Expiration Date",invoice:"Invoice",unsubscription:"Unsubscription",continueUsing:"Continue Using",creditHistory:"Credit history",unsubscriptionContent