 any suggestions, we hope you can tell us first, and we will improve them.",cancelSubscriptionTipDesc2:"If you decide to unsubscribe, the member rights and Meme in the current subscription period will not be affected, and you can still get 120 Meme per day. We hope you can stay, but if you need to unsubscribe, please tell us the reason, and we will try to do better.",cancelSubscriptionTip1Title:"Confirm to cancel the subscription again?",cancelSubscriptionTip1Descl:"We are sorry to see you want to cancel the subscription. If you have any issues, we hope you can tell us first, and we will improve them.",cancelSubscriptionTip1Desc2:"If you decide to unsubscribe, the member rights and Meme in the current subscription period will not be affected, and you can still get 120 Meme per day.",unsubscribe:"Unsubscribe",continueUsing:"Continue Using",unsubscribeSuccess:"You have successfully unsubscribed",creationReward:'DIGEN is the world\'s leading video creation community, helping you create unique video works. Our newly launched MEME points system is still being improved, and currently does not allow points to be obtained through recharge. We provide you with <span class="color-#FDC100">120</span><span style="font-weight:600"> login reward points</span> daily. If this does not meet your creative needs, please interact with us through Discord to receive an additional <span style="font-weight:600">daily</span><span class="color-#FDC100" style="font-weight:600">150</span><span style="font-weight:600"> creative incentive points</span>, ensuring your creative journey is not hindered by insufficient points. We will release new ways to obtain MEME soon, please continue to support us.',goDiscordGetMeme:"Go to DISCORD to get points",getYouReward:"Claim your MEME points creative incentive",supportToDiscord:"Contact Support",orderTipTitle:"You have an incomplete order",orderTipContent:"You have an unpaid order. Please try to pay again after 30 minutes. If you need help, feel free to p